# .mailmap
#
# Maps the git identities used during the project to one canonical name per
# team member, so `git shortlog` and `git log` report contributions accurately.
# Several members committed from both the GitHub web interface and a local
# terminal, which recorded a different author name, and sometimes a different
# email, for the same person.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical email> <email used in the commit>

